    <description>The Account/Program object is part of the Interventions App and links Programs and Schools/Accounts.  This linking occurs in the Interventions Setup when a school selects which interventions Programs they will enroll in for a specific year.  This object tracks the relationships of Programs and Schools and whether the Programs are active.</description>
